  data: {
    LLM: "Identify your partner early by observing who plays the XX. Conserve your high trumps to protect your partner's high-value cards.\n\nThe 'Talon' swap: Use the talon to discard your 'voids' (suits you have none of) so you can trump in on those suits later.\n\nMaster the cue-bid language. Knowing that your partner has the XIX and the XXI allows you to signal aggressive play styles.",
    Player: "Identify your partner early by observing who plays the XX. Conserve your high trumps to protect your partner's high-value cards.\n\nThe 'Talon' swap: Use the talon to discard your 'voids' (suits you have none of) so you can trump in on those suits later.\n\nMaster the cue-bid language. Knowing that your partner has the XIX and the XXI allows you to signal aggressive play styles.",
